### =========================================================
###  LOCAL   (run `npm run dev` first)
### =========================================================

### Hello World
GET http://localhost:3000/

### GET all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### GET one contact
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/6aa6a8c8fab1a8f90859de5b

### POST - create a contact (returns the new id)
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Grace",
  "lastName": "Hopper",
  "email": "grace.hopper@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "navy",
  "birthday": "1906-12-09"
}

### PUT - update a contact (paste the id from the POST above)
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/PASTE_NEW_ID_HERE HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Grace",
  "lastName": "Hopper",
  "email": "grace.hopper@navy.mil",
  "favoriteColor": "teal",
  "birthday": "1906-12-09"
}

### DELETE - remove a contact
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/PASTE_NEW_ID_HERE


